# A new user's forced password change: with the old password typed, F3
# asks only to quit and Esc only to log out, both refused; then the
# repetition differs, is cleared and typed again, and the home screen
# follows.
T NEWBIE
K ENTER
T newbie86
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
T newbie86
K F3
S MUSTQUIT
T N
K ESC
S LOGOUTQ
T N
K TAB
T Newbie1986
K TAB
T Newbie1987
K CTRL-S
S MISMATCH
K CTRL-Y
T Newbie1986
K CTRL-S
K ENTER
S HOME
K F3
T Y
